# TEST APP ONLY (TEST-APP-DIVERGENCE.md). Loaded by `vite --mode sync`.
VITE_SYNC_ENABLED=true
# PROMPT-09: this build's own PowerSync file. OPFS is per origin and every
# app here shares adamnc02.github.io, so it must differ from personal-f's
# 'personal-finance.db' and shared-finance-ledger's 'shared-finance-ledger.db'.
VITE_POWERSYNC_DB_FILENAME=finance-ledger-test-sync.db

# PROMPT-14 Part 7 (2026-09-22). The PUBLIC half of the VAPID pair the
# `ledger-alerts` Edge Function signs with. Public by definition — every
# browser that subscribes hands it to the push service — so it is committed,
# for the same reason VITE_POWERSYNC_DB_FILENAME above is: a build made
# without it cannot register for alerts, and should not be possible to make.
# The PRIVATE half is a Supabase function secret and is never in any repo.
#
# 🚨 IT MUST EQUAL THE FUNCTION'S OWN VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY. A subscription is
# bound to the key it was created with, so if these two ever differ every
# push fails 403 with nothing in the app to explain it.
# verify-notification-toggle.ts section 9 asserts they match.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=BB9I-sjb0TW_tjurRCh29HZ1Eab_sZBHKqnt1c7rBsagJxWDau0BnBCjybagPVJVIxImeOP87anjAKsVZX839Fk
